  "translation": "Ma ur tezmirem ara ad t-id-tesbegnet-iḍ iyyi, kečč-kun ad yi-tt-mudun ⟨iyyi⟩ tlata (30) i yiduran n leḥrir d tlata (30) n tḥerci n yilman. Nnan-as: Mudd-aɣ-d tanestit-ik, iwakken ad tt-nesleḍ!",
